<http://data.silknow.org/object/160a16a8-5a47-3b0e-a298-ebf026d073b2>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Two fragments from a piece, full width. Copperplate engraving, printed in brown on cotton cloth. When assembled, two fragments show full repeat. Main scene, at center, shows two ladies talking with a girl in a park; at the right, two ladies converse with a gentleman at the foot of a flight of stone steps with balustrade. Above, at left, two ladies being rowed in a boat by a man, past gothic ruins; at right, a lady and gentleman strolling in woods. Inscribed on edge of tread of bottom step: \"Drawn and Engrav'd By D. Richards (s reversed) Manch.r.\" Cotton darkened and brittle; many holes and tears; darning."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/c7e0e4d2-b1d5-346d-b487-d2eef2f65199> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Two fragments from a piece, full width. Copperplate engraving, printed in brown on cotton cloth. When assembled, two fragments show full repeat. Main scene, at center, shows two ladies talking with a girl in a park; at the right, two ladies converse with a gentleman at the foot of a flight of stone steps with balustrade. Above, at left, two ladies being rowed in a boat by a man, past gothic ruins; at right, a lady and gentleman strolling in woods. Inscribed on edge of tread of bottom step: \"Drawn and Engrav'd By D. Richards (s reversed) Manch.r.\" Cotton darkened and brittle; many holes and tears; darning."@en ;
